/*
New function- Permaremove(): Significantly expands the WEIDU delete function (dangerous!).
Notes:
This is a powerful feature that, for reasons of convention, may only be used in the 
Randomizer and to enable its core functionality.
-----
*/
DEFINE_ACTION_FUNCTION DELETE_MOD_AydenWarlock

    BEGIN
    	PERMAREMOVE ~AYDEN/SETUP-AYDEN.tp2~
	END
